WEBVTT

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.400
Looks like our balance this month is negative, too.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.720
We'll have to raise our prices.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.730
How does pricing coffee at 10,000 yen sound?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.200
Let's just do a table charge of 100,000 yen.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.610
Those are the prices of the sleepless district of Kabukicho in Shinjuku.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:25.520
Crap! What are you doing?

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.420
Phantasmoon's about to start!

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:41.680
Magic Circuit Maximum Power!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.310
Last Arc!

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.230
Marble Phantasm!

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:55.630
This was so that mushrooms could be like mushrooms!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:02.370
Welcome back, your Marble Phantasm.

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:05.710
This was all a tragedy brought about by human ego.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.840
The battle isn't over yet, Phantasmoon!

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.670
Who's that?!

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.760
I'm the magical girl of love and justice from another world, Kaleido-Ruby!

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:21.560
I'm the abusive magical girl of celebration and peace, Magical Caren.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:25.600
I'm the black-curtain magical girl of
proverbs and medicine, Magical Amber!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.270
White Moon Princess, now is the time to fight this out!

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.980
What?!

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.640
And we finally have Ren's finished product!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:39.980
Eww, is this Kansai-style?

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:41.120
This wasn't what we agreed on!

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.700
And what is the true identity of this perfect double of the murdered demon Akiha?

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.290
Next time, on a new series.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.290
White Moon Princess Phantasmoon: Hardcore!

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:53.330
I'll use a new Marble Phantasm on your heart!

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.510
Be sure to tune in!

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.340
Isn't sMoon-san the best?

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.180
sMoon-san's totally sMoon.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.100
Okay, everybody together!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.550
sMoon!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.960
sMoon.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.890
Wait, who are you?

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.170
It's starting.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.680
Sakura!

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.580
Stop going to Emiya's place!

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:56.360
You're <i>my</i> sister, so I'm the only one you listen to!

00:03:58.240 --> 00:03:59.090
Nii-san...

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:03.580
Two siblings at the mercy of the
blood-stained fate of the Matou family.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:04.840
Shinji and Sakura.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:10.220
What does Sakura see at the end of all the fighting?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.810
What's this?

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.360
I can't open the door!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.810
Is it because of the snow?

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.890
Sakura!

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.120
Hey, Sakura!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.500
Hurry up and shovel the snow, Sakura!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.740
The whole house!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.380
Nothing beats surfing the 'net in a warm room on a cold day like this!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.000
Some idiot fell for my elaborate trick again!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:48.920
Dumbass.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.410
You mad? You mad?!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.760
It's so cold...

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.520
What are you doing, Sakura?!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.520
It's unbelievable that you haven't finished shovelling yet!

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.780
Sorry! I'll finish it right away...

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.870
Slow! Fool! I'm hungry!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.900
And buy me this week's Jump magazine!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.200
Nii-san...

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.200
He forces all the chores onto his sister.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:15.350
You're fine with Shinji ordering you around?

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.290
Sakura, at this rate, you'll-

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.210
Stop it, Rider!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.150
I'm sorry, but I'll be fine.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.970
But I'm not.

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:30.100
I have to take care of Nii-san.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.110
Yet I still go over to Senpai's house...

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.620
I'm such an idiot.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.720
Even though I have such a great body...

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.960
This is really good, Sakura.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.960
At least you're good at cooking!

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:04.230
I can't make anything besides instant food, so I don't know what I'd do without you.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:10.930
Sakura is unable to run away because his violence frightens her.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:16.180
But at the same time, she feels that he can't get by without her.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.260
Sakura, girl of destiny.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:22.200
What lies ahead of this fruitless relationship?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.480
Is it hope?

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.770
Or is it despair?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:27.950
Sakura!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.280
You went to Emiya's place again?!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.910
How many times must I tell you to leave him alo-

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.420
I'm sorry, Master.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.250
I was taking the laundry in.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.430
You moron!

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.150
Nobody brings in the pole with the laundry!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:42.880
It's different where I come from...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.710
It's the same in every country!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.860
Um, "Airhead" is a skill I possess...

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.630
Liar!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.260
Your status information hasn't been updated at all!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.150
You'd better watch out!

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.970
Sakura, you better remember what I was saying!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.850
Sakura!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.350
Where were you during morning practice?

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.360
I keep telling you every day to leave Emiya alo-

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.520
Sorry, Master.

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:10.110
I messed up where the brakes were by accident.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.020
Rider! You shouldn't be riding bicycles in the house to begin with!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.080
But my Riding skill is ranked A+.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.740
Didn't you just fail at riding?!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:17.750
Damn it!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.730
Why was I given such a useless Servant?!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.220
Please realize.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.810
Sakura.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.760
That this man isn't a threat to you!

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:32.750
Because you are...

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.870
Watch out, Master!

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:44.640
This would've killed someone!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.320
If it wasn't me, you would've killed someone!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.030
In fact, you just killed this stranger in blue full-body tights next to me!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.270
Rider.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:57.410
Could it be that you're protecting me?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.650
Y-You know?

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.990
Nii-san does have his good points.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.560
He's like that right now because he feels insecure...

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.170
But he was much kinder back then-

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.710
Do you mean what you're saying?

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:15.860
Sakura, if you'll be my Master, I'll immediately-

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.170
Stop it, Rider.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.280
You can't.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.980
Despite all that, he's still my brother.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.730
Sakura, you'll be ruined at this rate-

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:28.230
Geez, that's enough! Leave me alone, Rider!

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.360
You got more votes than me in the popularity polls anyway.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.860
S-Sakura...

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.690
I'll settle this myself.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.870
Because I'm...

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.770
...beautiful, brave, and devoted.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:59.100
Today's dish is hamburger~

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.770
I wonder if Soichiro-sama will eat a lot.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.370
I'm sure he will!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:11.200
Despite all that, Sakura still has lingering affections for Shinji.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.400
That's where the neck of it all is.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:18.660
Huh? Where's my wallet?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.490
Is that... Rule Breaker?!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.420
No, Nii-san!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.310
What do you mean, no?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.300
I know you actually like this.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.420
No! Don't fall prey to my beauty!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.680
Sakura! Use this!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.180
What?

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:41.140
The unstoppable urges of youth!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:41.930
No.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.430
Sakura...

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.090
Nii-san...

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.830
Nii-san.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.440
You were so kind.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.630
And I was so cute.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.650
Nii-san's evil heart is being cleansed.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:10.040
What a sexy scene to behold.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.710
Looks like a new addition to the gallery-

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.880
What have you done, Rider?!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.170
Nii-san only made others look good <i>because</i> he was such a loser!

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.300
Right...

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.870
I'm sorry I got mad at you.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.840
You did it all for my sake.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.420
Ah... No problem.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:33.370
Nii-san became such a monster because of society...

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.170
...and me.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.340
Because I'm a beautiful, ill-fated girl.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:42.270
What does Sakura see at the end of all the fighting?

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.800
Is it light?

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.240
Or is it darkness?

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:48.240
Sakura, girl of destiny.

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:52.230
Nobody knows what is in her heart.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.300
Is this what you'd call sibling love?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.890
Isn't it wonderful?

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:05.600
We all have the same faces, so does that make us siblings?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.150
Next section coming up.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:18.150
Excuse me, do you mind sharing your table with another customer?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.720
No, not at all.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:24.530
Is your master really such a dangerous woman?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.250
Geez! You really don't get it, Archer-san!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:30.500
Women with secretarial airs like her are actually monsters underneath!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.630
Guys are so naïve to think that glasses represent intelligence.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.720
I can't disagree with that.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.550
There's more to female masters than meets the eye.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.440
Yes!

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:44.240
Seeing them pretend to be honors students is so ridiculous that you can't help but think humans are so disgusting!

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.640
Seriously, all female masters are idiots!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.860
I totally agree.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.920
Welcome.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.770
Let me take you both to your seats.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.500
What?

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.520
What's the meaning of this?!

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.410
Instructor, we're having serious budget problems!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.270
Wha-?!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.500
I'll force this in! Next episode!
